==English==

===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|es|sapodilla}}, from {{der|en|nah|tzapocuahuitl}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˌsæpəˈdɪlə/}}
* {{rhymes|en|ɪlə|s=4}}

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}

# A long-lived [[evergreen]] [[tree]], {{taxfmt|Manilkara zapota|species}}, native to the New World tropics.
# The edible [[fruit]] of this tree.
